<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>PANAMERA MEDIA CO</title>
<style>
 *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
 body{font-family:-apple-system,Inter,Helvetica;background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
 .breaking{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:8px 16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
 header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#fff;border-bottom:1.5px solid #0a0a0a}
 .topbar{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
 .logo{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-size:20px}
 .container{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
 .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 0.7fr;gap:20px;padding:28px 0}
 .video{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#0a0a0a}
 .video iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
 .hero-text{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
 .eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:12px}
 .hero-text h1{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:0.9}
 .pink{color:#FF2E93} .blue{color:#38B6FF} .yellow{color:#FFD60A}
 .hero-text p{margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.5}
 .btns{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
 .btn{padding:13px 20px;border-radius:100px;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;display:inline-flex}
 .btn-black{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff} .btn-white{background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
 .podcast-section{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.8fr 1.2fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}
 .podcast-text h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;line-height:0.9}
 .podcast-text p{font-size:13px;opacity:0.6;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.4}
 .podcast-embed{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
 .podcast-embed iframe{width:100%;height:175px;border:0}
 .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:28px}
 .card{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;background:#fff}
 .card h4{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:8px}
 .card a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
 .section{padding:28px 0;border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a}
 .section h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:18px}
 .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
 .story{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;background:#fff}
 .thumb{aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden}
 .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
 .body{padding:14px} .body h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:800} .body p{font-size:12px;opacity:0.5;margin-top:4px}
 footer{border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;padding:24px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5}
 @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.podcast-section{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="breaking">PANAMERA MEDIA CO — SESIONES EN VIVO</div>
<header><div class="topbar"><div class="logo">PANAMERA MEDIA CO</div><div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5">PANAMERAMEDIA.COM</div></div></header>

<div class="container">
 <div class="hero">
   <div class="video">
     <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gDpzAbgRVvw?rel=0" title="Martin Lagares - Panamera Sesiones" allowfullscreen></iframe>
   </div>
   <div class="hero-text">
     <div class="eyebrow">ENTREVISTA DESTACADA • VIDEO</div>
     <h1><span class="pink">MARTIN</span> <span class="blue">LAGARES</span> <span class="yellow">EN VIVO</span></h1>
     <p>Entrevistas y sesiones que celebran lo que somos.</p>
     <div class="btns">
       <a class="btn btn-black" href="https://youtu.be/gDpzAbgRVvw" target="_blank">▶ Ver Video</a>
       <a class="btn btn-white" href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank">Canal</a>
     </div>
   </div>
 </div>

 <div class="podcast-section">
   <div class="podcast-text">
     <div class="eyebrow">PODCAST DESTACADO • AUDIO</div>
     <h2><span class="pink">KAT</span> <span class="blue">RIGONI</span> <br><span class="yellow">MEXICAN ACTRESS</span></h2>
     <p>Escucha la entrevista completa con Kat Rigoni en Panamera Sesiones. Disponible en Apple Podcasts.</p>
     <div class="btns" style="margin-top:14px">
       <a class="btn btn-black" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633?i=1000784832795" target="_blank">🎙️ Escuchar en Apple</a>
     </div>
   </div>
   <div class="podcast-embed">
     <iframe allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *; fullscreen *; clipboard-write" frameborder="0" height="175" style="width:100%;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-storage-access-by-user-activation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" src="https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633?i=1000784832795"></iframe>
   </div>
 </div>

 <div class="cards">
   <div class="card"><h4>Escucha</h4><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633" target="_blank">Apple Podcasts <span>→</span></a></div>
   <div class="card"><h4>Mira</h4><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank">YouTube <span>→</span></a></div>
   <div class="card"><h4>Sigue</h4><a href="https://www.instagram.com/panameramediaco/" target="_blank">@panameramediaco <span>→</span></a></div>
 </div>

 <div class="section">
   <div class="eyebrow">ON THE LOOP • 34TH HAMPTONS INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL</div>
   <h2><span class="pink">HAMPTONS</span> <span class="blue">INTERNATIONAL</span> <span class="yellow">FILM FESTIVAL</span> — ON THE LOOP</h2>
   <div class="grid">
     <a class="story" href="/capsized" style="border-width:2px">
       <div class="thumb"><img src="/capsized-1.jpeg" alt="Capsized - Hamptons Film Festival" /></div>
       <div class="body"><h4>Capsized — Film Coverage</h4><p>34th Hamptons International Film Festival • On The Loop</p></div>
     </a>
     <a class="story" href="https://youtu.be/gDpzAbgRVvw" target="_blank"><div class="thumb">MARTIN LAGARES</div><div class="body"><h4>Martin Lagares En Vivo</h4><p>Video Entrevista</p></div></a>
     <a class="story" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633?i=1000784832795" target="_blank"><div class="thumb">KAT RIGONI</div><div class="body"><h4>Kat Rigoni - Mexican Actress</h4><p>Podcast Entrevista</p></div></a>
   </div>
 </div>
</div>

<footer>PANAMERA MEDIA CO © 2026</footer>
</body>
</html>
